        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bazar Simulator Online</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will step into the shoes of young Wan, who is in charge of managing his uncle Wang Long's bazaar. After “Bazaar Simulator: Wan's Story,” he will take over the bazaar with his friends Tomasito and Eugenio.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What can you do in the game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📋 Manage the bazaar cooperatively with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and customize: Choose furniture, paint the walls, and customize the floor to your liking. Purchase upgrades: Expand and improve your store to attract more customers. Keep things tidy: Restock merchandise, organize shelves, and keep your customers happy.</p>",
